# --- factorial v3 roots (Models/<root>/<mode>/<cell>/seed<k>/) ----------------
# Same shape as the v2 roots. Two additions, both driven by the three-arm
# architecture comparison: confusion_matrix.csv, because dl_08b's FSW<->UPL
# contrast is computed from the per-cell matrix and should be reproducible from a
# git pull alone; and seed*/gates/*.npz, the fusion gate rasters, which are a
# deliverable (float16, ~0.5 MB/patch) rather than a debug artifact.
!Models/factorial_results_v3/
!Models/results_arch_v3/
!Models/results_arch_fusion_v3/
!Models/factorial_results_v3/*/
!Models/results_arch_v3/*/
!Models/results_arch_fusion_v3/*/
!Models/factorial_results_v3/*/analysis/
!Models/results_arch_v3/*/analysis/
!Models/results_arch_fusion_v3/*/analysis/
!Models/factorial_results_v3/*/analysis/**
!Models/results_arch_v3/*/analysis/**
!Models/results_arch_fusion_v3/*/analysis/**
!Models/factorial_results_v3/*/*/
!Models/results_arch_v3/*/*/
!Models/results_arch_fusion_v3/*/*/
!Models/factorial_results_v3/*/*/seed*/
!Models/results_arch_v3/*/*/seed*/
!Models/results_arch_fusion_v3/*/*/seed*/
